                                "sense_id": "6325b7d7-c76e-3a8e-bef0-733a15f8da88",
                                "text": "Peiping, one of the oldest cities in the world, and one of the most interesting! He who has not seen Peiping has really not seen the China of fable and history."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2589dfa8-36e0-494b-ad78-822d7b99a1d4",
                                "sense_id": "6325b7d7-c76e-3a8e-bef0-733a15f8da88",
                                "text": "On July 7, 1937, the Japanese during maneuvers attacked the Marco Polo bridge (Lu-kou-ch'iao) across the Yung-ting Ho southwest of Peiping to sever the last railroad link with the rest of China."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3bb61646-e828-426a-b362-c2c59add0e6d",
                                "sense_id": "6325b7d7-c76e-3a8e-bef0-733a15f8da88",
                                "text": "Commenting on a wire service report of March 9 saying that a foreign journalist stationed in Peiping has been in contact with counterparts in Taipei via Tokyo tele-communications facilities, the GIO said \"This is another form of Chinese Communist united front conspiracy carried out through foreign journalists.\""
